A,          | Print F(0) = 0.
B+,         | Print F(1) = 1.
{           |
  A-        |
  {-C+A}    | Set C = A.
  B-        |
  {-C+A+B}  | Set C = A + B, while setting A = B.
  C,        | Print C, which now equals F(n) = F(n-2) + F(n-1).
  -         |
  {-B+C}    | Reset C to zero, while setting B = C.
  A+-       | Set conditional register c to false for infinite loop.
}           |
